{
  "id": 19,
  "name": "return_aware_progress",
  "intent": "Augments nearest neighbor with a return penalty that intensifies as the tour advances (0.25 + 0.5*progress), curbing late-stage detours that inflate the final leg home, while a small regret bonus (0.15) discourages locally cheap picks that strand the route with poor successors.",
